Third-party notice

scripts/lib/client_auth.py is derived from buddy_station.py in the
totorosir-workbuddy-score skill by totorosir, which is released under MIT-0
(no attribution required). The extraction is documented at the top of that
file. That upstream file in turn implements decryption of the local client's
own credential store; no third-party credential, key, or token is bundled
with this skill.
